<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I called the Motoki-cho police right away and asked them to check <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s apartment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I put <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> to bed on a futon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first she was shaking all over, but as I kept holding her and <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="な">stroking</STYLE> her head, she eventually fell asleep.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE> and the others went straight to the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE> house, home of the voice from earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Left in this house were the three of us from Motoki-cho, <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="6">my mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> got the frightened <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> to sleep with her head in her lap.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> was <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おび">scared</STYLE> after coming face to face with a murder.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Why </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s parents...! Those two have nothing to do with this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this is a curse-killing... Every year in April, someone dies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And this time, two people with no connection to the Arata settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"But this has made one thing clear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Judging from what that Shirozaki person said, the curse-killing cases were the residents killing each other out of suspicion of one another..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suspecting each other, killing each other.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, so that's what the curse-killings really are...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"But why </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s parents... those two shouldn't have had anything to do with it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Maybe it has something to do with what happened in Megasawa. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Not that there's any way of finding out now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"No, it's not settled that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s parents are dead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Let's wait to hear back from the police..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Um... what kind of person is this Shirozaki-san?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Shirozaki-san's a good-natured old guy who loves his drink... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">He's really the kind of guy you'd think 'no way' about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... From the sound of it, Shirozaki-san wasn't the only one who attacked them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">It felt like there were several others there too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> said, there'd been the sense of several people on the other end of the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their distrust must have exploded, and they'd all banded together in the worst way.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, if Shirozaki-san lashed out because of paranoia... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">then that'd mean the one we've been calling 'the culprit' cut off the head of </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, who died in an accident or by suicide, but never killed anyone, and hasn't done anything since?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"No, then there'd be no reason for a curse-killing case to happen the next year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">For a while, the culprit must have been acting too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But at some point the culprit achieved the goal and stopped the curse-killings, while the suspicion all around kept going, and that turned into the serial curse-killing cases... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Isn't that it? And this time, people from outside the settlement finally became targets too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A cell number I didn't know. Was it the Motoki-cho police?<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Hello!? This is Niimura!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Ah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">. My name is Ise, with the Motoki Police Station. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">A short while ago, we searched </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'s residence."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"And... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">what did you find...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> and I swallowed hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That one short <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="た">pause</STYLE> felt terribly long.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Well, at </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'s home... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">there was no one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">No signs of a struggle at all, either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"No one... was there...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I'd thought it would be one or the other: either they'd find bodies, or <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents would be there as if nothing had happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But neither of those...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Was the car there!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s... no, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s car!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"The car was there. Isn't it possible they went out on foot?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Both of them going out on foot together, right in the middle of a conversation like that!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Please search the whole Motoki-cho area right away! I'm somewhere far away right now, and I can't get over there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Hmm... Let's see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">I understand how you feel, but when nothing has happened, going any further than this is..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"It already has happened! They were abducted, I'm sure of it! So please, search right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The police won't move unless something has happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, they won't move until they've <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="・・・・・・">recognized</STYLE> that something has happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How else am I supposed to explain it...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="11">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Understood. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">It is a fact that </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> and her husband are actually missing, so we will set up a cordon in town and stop every passing vehicle at checkpoints. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">If we have not found them by morning, we will request assistance from the Sawa Prefectural Police."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh...? Th-thank you very much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Against my expectations, the response I got was a kind one.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"No, no, there's no need for thanks. Motoki-cho is so peaceful that we at the Motoki police have time on our hands. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Besides, the role of the police is to protect everyone's safety and peace of mind. Giving people peace of mind is part of our job as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I really do appreciate it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Well then, that's all. I have to get back to the search myself. I'll be in touch again."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, the Motoki police said they'll search the whole town top to bottom right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was happy with how the police were handling it, but <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>'s face stayed dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Even so... I still think something has happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s parents..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yeah... you're right..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Far from being reassuring, it had only become more likely that <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents really had been attacked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Kogori home had been empty. That alone was strange enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Just then, the door of the room slid slowly open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It was <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... I went and looked around a little too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her expression was somehow gloomy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"So...! What about Shirozaki-san!? Did that guy really do it!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Everyone was gone... </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\和の廃墟.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Shirozaki-san too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">the people from the other houses, all of them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"All the residents vanished...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which meant that at some point, they'd all gone over to Motoki-cho?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... that would be way too bold a move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that many people went and committed the crime, they'd stand out.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. Then that means </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s parents were abducted and killed somewhere else, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I said that, <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> seemed to sink into thought a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She probably couldn't agree with what I'd said.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Couldn't it be that they weren't abducted, but went to the crime scene of their own free will? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s call got answered right away, and from the way he talked, it didn't sound like they'd been abducted, did it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True. If they'd been abducted, they probably couldn't have made a call, and if they could use a phone, they'd have asked for help right away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">the truth is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> began to speak, struggling to get the words out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE>'s shoulders began to shake.
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what's wrong? Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬土下座.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> sank to the floor as if she'd crumpled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm sorry...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　It was me...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　It's my fault...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, calm down...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Tell me what happened... take it slow, it's okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When she heard that exchange, <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> picked up her notepad, still letting <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> sleep in her lap.<PG>
It sounded like she was saying that because of <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents had been killed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it was obvious that <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> hadn't done anything directly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now I had to calm her down and get her to talk.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and the others... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">were killed in the storage shed at Arata Station..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents had been at Arata Station?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why not Motoki-cho?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I told them to hide in the storage shed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> told them that...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> have been driven by distrust too, and done that to <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you didn't give orders to Shirozaki-san and the others, did you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"No! Of course not!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> lifted her head and denied it desperately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a moment I'd suspected <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE>, but I'd been hoping she would deny it like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> said nothing, taking notes on the conversation.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I can't take this anymore... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Because I'm here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> too... </STYLE>
